{"ref":"BDB, לַ֫חַשׁ","hw":"לַ֫חַשׁ","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">לַ֫חַשׁ</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>a whispering, charming</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">ל׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 26:16\" href=\"/Isaiah.26.16\">Is 26:16</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">לָ֑חַשׁ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 10:11\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.10.11\">Ec 10:11</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 3:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.3.3\">Is 3:3</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 8:17\" href=\"/Jeremiah.8.17\">Je 8:17</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">לְחָשִׁים</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 3:20\" href=\"/Isaiah.3.20\">Is 3:20</a>.—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>serpent-charming</em> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 8:17\" href=\"/Jeremiah.8.17\">Je 8:17</a> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 10:11\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.10.11\">Ec 10:11</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">לָ֑חַשׁ נְבוֹן</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 3:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.3.3\">Is 3:3</a> (prob. general).<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>charms, amulets</em>, worn by women, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 3:20\" href=\"/Isaiah.3.20\">Is 3:20</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  <em>whisper of prayer</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">צָקוּן לַחַשׁ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 26:16\" href=\"/Isaiah.26.16\">Is 26:16</a> <em>they pour forth a whisper of prayer</em> (but Koppe Bö Gr Di Du read <span dir=\"rtl\">צְקוֹן לַחַשׁ</span> ‘<em>Zauberzwang</em>,’ <em>compulsion of</em> (<em>by</em>) <em>magic</em>).","next":"BDB, לוֹחֵשׁ","prev":"BDB, לָחַשׁ"}